{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-o190a","title":"曹彰讨破乌丸反叛","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-o190a-account","label":"正文","text":"代郡、上谷乌丸无臣氐等叛，曹彰奉命讨破。","evidence":["wudi-e-o190a-q"]},{"id":"rencheng-a-3aa692c26569a5f56493","label":"正文","text":"乌丸反，曹彰受任北征","evidence":["rencheng-q-dcf4617d2d2b4746aa58"]},{"id":"rencheng-a-01daa319759288cb89e9","label":"正文","text":"曹彰用田豫计守隙，追胡至桑干","evidence":["rencheng-q-b45b61354b406adfd060"]},{"id":"rencheng-a-0a395f788bee784a58be","label":"正文","text":"曹彰违诸将劝阻深追破胡并赏军，轲比能请服","evidence":["rencheng-q-479da0564d307675282d"]},{"id":"hechang-a-f649083e2e53923e47ac","label":"正文","text":"代三单于反曹操遣曹彰征之","evidence":["hechang-q-b27e05f56a5965814db0"]},{"id":"wuhuan-a-c12d788c09950ffb7f87","label":"正文","text":"鄢陵侯彰（曹彰）北征，大破之，比能走出塞","evidence":["wuhuan-q-e96cf4b24c7d7e801b5a"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0379","role":"反叛","evidence":["wudi-e-o190a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0380","role":"征讨","evidence":["wudi-e-o190a-q"]},{"person":"cao-cao","role":"告诫者","evidence":["rencheng-q-dcf4617d2d2b4746aa58"]},{"person":"mingdi-p0025","role":"献计者","evidence":["rencheng-q-b45b61354b406adfd060"]},{"person":"wendi-p0032","role":"请服者","evidence":["rencheng-q-479da0564d307675282d"]}],"place":{"text":"代郡、上谷","evidence":["wudi-e-o190a-q"]},"time":{"label":"建安二十三年夏四月","year":218,"precision":"year","basis":"纪年经本批逐段审定；年份依据见所引原文纪年与现代注释。","evidence":["wudi-e-o190a-q","wudi-q-o188","wudi-q-b-ac93ccb47f6e7be3aea4"],"chronology":"wudi-y218","dating_review":{"anchor":"wudi-q-o188","basis":"建安二十三年夏四月","reviewed":true}},"source_order":[1,1074,"O190a"],"order":411}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"mingdi-p0025","name":"田豫","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wendi-p0032","name":"轲比能","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0379","name":"无臣氐","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0380","name":"曹彰","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"hechang-q-b27e05f56a5965814db0","section":"chapter-023","block":"b-70b462befe881dec6b24","layer":"original","quote":"后数十日，三单于反问至〖17〗。乃遣鄢陵侯彰为骁骑将军征之〖18〗。","section_title":"和常杨杜赵裴传第二十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0052.xhtml","index":341,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":123,"end":157,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rencheng-q-479da0564d307675282d","section":"chapter-019","block":"b-0fd4abfd4b629e185b55","layer":"original","quote":"长史、诸将皆以为：“新涉远，士马疲顿；又受节度，不得过代：不可深进违令轻敌！”彰曰：“率师而行，唯利所在，何节度乎！胡走未远，追之必破；从令纵敌，非良将也。”遂上马，令军中：“后出者，斩！”一日一夜与虏相及；击，大破之，斩首、获生以千数。彰乃倍常科大赐将士〖8〗，将士无不悦喜。时鲜卑大人轲比能，将数万骑观望强弱；见彰力战，所向皆破，乃请服。北方悉平。","section_title":"任城陈萧王传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0043.xhtml","index":3,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":194,"end":370,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rencheng-q-b45b61354b406adfd060","section":"chapter-019","block":"b-0fd4abfd4b629e185b55","layer":"original","quote":"彰北征，入涿郡界；叛胡数千骑，猝至。时兵马未集，唯有步卒千人，骑数百匹；用田豫计，固守要隙〖5〗，虏乃退散。彰追之，身自搏战，射胡骑，应弦而倒者前后相属。战过半日，彰铠中数箭，意气益厉；乘胜逐北，至于桑干〖6〗，﹝一﹞去代二百余里","section_title":"任城陈萧王传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0043.xhtml","index":3,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":75,"end":190,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rencheng-q-dcf4617d2d2b4746aa58","section":"chapter-019","block":"b-0fd4abfd4b629e185b55","layer":"original","quote":"二十三年〖4〗，代郡乌丸反，以彰为北中郎将，行骁骑将军。临发，太祖戒彰曰：“居家为父子，受事为君臣；动以王法从事，尔其戒之！”","section_title":"任城陈萧王传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0043.xhtml","index":3,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":12,"end":75,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-o190a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-5c3f2aa022959a9cbb2b","layer":"original","quote":"夏四月，代郡、上谷乌丸无臣氐等叛〖7〗。遣鄢陵侯彰讨破之〖8〗。﹝三﹞","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":398,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":35,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-ac93ccb47f6e7be3aea4","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-ac93ccb47f6e7be3aea4","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二十三年：建安二十三年（公元 218）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":403,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-8cae36984cdc22e48444","start":0,"end":23,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o188","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-1336d4803d0b76311776","layer":"original","quote":"二十三年春正月〖1〗，汉太医令吉本与少府耿纪、司直韦晃等反〖2〗。攻许，烧丞相长史王必营〖3〗。﹝一﹞必与颍川典农中郎将严匡讨斩之〖4〗。﹝二﹞","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":396,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":72,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuhuan-q-e96cf4b24c7d7e801b5a","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-a1b338a00ad6850092a4","layer":"original","quote":"北征，大破之。比能走出塞","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":68,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":69,"end":81,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
